From: Lexcubia <lexcubia@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 01:42:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 14/45] chore(repo): husky lint-staged, remove release
 pre-check, fix api docker build

Release workflow no longer runs test/typecheck (moved to CI on develop/main push); husky+lint-staged for local commits; add python3/make/g++ to API build stages for better-sqlite3.
---
 .github/workflows/release.yml | 23 +----------------------
 .husky/pre-commit             |  1 +
 apps/api/Dockerfile           |  4 ++++
 deploy/Dockerfile.app         |  4 ++++
 docs/VERSIONING.md            |  8 +++++++-
 package.json                  | 14 +++++++++++++-
 pnpm-lock.yaml                | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 .husky/pre-commit

